{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1045753-chat-based-play","id":1045753,"title":"Chat based play?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-02-08T07:36:58-08:00","id":1045753,"title":"Chat based play?","content":"Do any of you play in or know of cWoD Games that are played based on chat (not forum posts)?<br /> <br /> Today the mood struck me to start cooking up a new Ananasi character but I have no idea where to play her. I realize there are forum based games but that style proved to be not really my thing while I have better experience with playing \u201cmore directly\u201c via chat. I havent played in english in ages but i think that will be fine as well if time differences can be sorted out. I live in germany.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11694-hexer","name":"Hexer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11694_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"93"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-08T08:40:07-08:00","id":1045786,"title":"","content":"If you're thinking of a chat in the vein of the old New Bremen chat, there's still a few around.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure of any that are still operating that have active Fera games. Most are too small for anything beyond the core characters. The Conventions. Gatherings. and Online play forums has a couple in there. The Unmoderated chat is still active in some incarnation with the advantage of letting you play whatever you want, and the downside of everyone playing whatever they want.<br /> <br /> There's a lot of people that use real-time chat platforms for more TT style play, but there isn't a great resource for finding those groups and joining them. I know someone here made a Facebook group dedicated to online play that might be a place to go looking for them.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-08T09:00:38-08:00","id":1045802,"title":"","content":"Personally I prefer MUSHes/MUXes over pure chat based roleplay. Mostly because you get completely built and descriptive surroundings (and character descriptions), an established city setting, dice commands, interactive Character Generation, storyteller staff, characters in different Splat spheres (Including Fera) and a lot more. Although I can see the sandboxy appeal of a pure chat.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-08T11:15:44-08:00","id":1045872,"title":"","content":"I've never tried the MUSH/MUX stuff I have to admit and I also dont know the New Bremen chat. I mostly played chat based within MMORPGs and sometimes, when there was something to play out that we couldnt find a suitable ingame location for we'd move it to skype (still only text based).<br /> Readily available surroundings might actually help (for example, I dont have any idea on where to locate that particular char yet). Any links I could check out maybe?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11694-hexer","name":"Hexer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11694_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"93"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-08T11:46:31-08:00","id":1045888,"title":"","content":"For WoD MUSHes?<br /> <br /> Check <a href=\"http://mudstats.com/Genre/WorldofDarkness\" target=\"_blank\">http://mudstats.com/Genre/WorldofDarkness</a><br /> <br /> Go for those that actually have somethingsomethingMUSH or MUX in the 'server type' column.<br /> <br /> You'll also need a nice client. I suggest <a href=\"http://www.potatomushclient.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.potatomushclient.com/</a> as it's available for the everything, and under active delopment.<br /> <br /> And last but not least an (ancient but okay) tutorial of the basics:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.gammon.com.au/mush/mush.htm\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.gammon.com.au/mush/mush.htm\" target=\"_blank\"> Playing MUSH games </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.gammon.com.au/mush/mush.htm\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.gammon.com.au/mush/mush.htm </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Playing MUSH games </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> Usually the MU*s have chat channels (think of them like, really, chat channels on MMORPGs just with less spam) where you can ask newbie questions, introduce yourself to the game and the like. Also these days MU*s have Wiki pages that help a LOT, unlike the old days <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> If you have any questions feel free to IM me here. And/Or share experiences right here!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-08T13:06:06-08:00","id":1045930,"title":"","content":"If you're looking for something of the New Bremen type chat:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.immortalvigilance.net/index.php\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.immortalvigilance.net/index.php</a><br /> <br /> They're probably the most readily accessible in terms of what that kind of chat is like. It's not that different from the MU* approach, though there's generally less integration into the chat program. There's more out there, but many of them have had to switch chat clients to things that aren't as friendly to people new to this particular style of it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-08T13:31:11-08:00","id":1045956,"title":"","content":"I feel old , but whats a MUSH?<br /> <br /> also what the hell is a SPLAT?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12902-wisdominchains","name":"WISDOMINCHAINS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12902_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-08T14:33:28-08:00","id":1046002,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WISDOMINCHAINS</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1045753-chat-based-play?p=1045956#post1045956\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I feel old , but whats a MUSH?<br /> <br /> also what the hell is a SPLAT?</div> </div> </div> </div>MUSH = Multi-User Shared Habitat (online role-playing)<br /> Splat is just a supernatural group. So Werewolves and Vampires are 2 of the splats in WoD.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/805-idpersona","name":"idpersona","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar805_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-08T18:10:24-08:00","id":1046095,"title":"","content":"Splat is a reference to the asterisk symbol. In searches * is used as a wildcard. So when people type MU* it means MUSH, MU, and so on.<br /> <br /> It became a short hand for WW's Clanbook/Tribebook/etc. as *books, or splatbooks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-08T22:32:57-08:00","id":1046183,"title":"","content":"I searched a bit yesterday and actually found a small german community that I will try out. I will take a look at the other links you guys post(ed), too. Thanks for the recommendations!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11694-hexer","name":"Hexer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11694_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"93"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-25T06:55:05-07:00","id":1067996,"title":"","content":"Yes, SAMP server. PM me for more informations","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13055-goran","name":"Goran.","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"60"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-30T11:45:35-07:00","id":1070775,"title":"","content":"was involved with one on skype, but got let go for having divisive opinions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"htt